// pio_fifo: DEPTH x 32 FIFO, one direction (docs/mvp-isa.md "### Engine state", DS 3.2.3.5).
// DEPTH = 4 is the MVP; 2..16 for the bench's parametric chip (tools/bench/sim/REGMAP.md).
// Push and pop are qualified by the start-of-cycle full/empty state, so a push to a full FIFO
